Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 14:44:09 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tui): add /invaders, Space Invaders in the right half of
 the session

/invaders (or /space-invaders) opens the game in the right half of the
session screen, in place of the sidebar, while the conversation keeps
the left half and the agent keeps working. The arrow keys, space and p
belong to the game while it is open and the prompt does not take keys;
escape closes and pauses it, and /invaders reopens it where it left
off. Up to three shots in the air, an extra life every 1500 points, a
mystery ship, and a field that fits the panel.

